    {
      "v": 9,
      "zh": "约雅斤登基的时候年八岁（在列王下二十四章八节是十八岁），在耶路撒冷作王三个月零十天，行耶和华眼中看为恶的事。",
      "en": "Jehoiachin was eighteen[NOTE:1] years old when he became king, and he reigned three months and ten days in Jerusalem.[NOTE:2] He did evil in the sight of[NOTE:3] the Lord.",
      "notes": [
